<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<!-- JNNP RoboDojo game field.
     Layout traced from Figure 2 (isometric view), outer size 6.704 m x 4.868 m from Figure 1:
       1 terrain zones (ramp + sand, ramp + gravel, grater, grass)   2 random time-based dynamic barrier
       3 randomly placed cylinders (spawned by game_field.launch.py) 4 loading zone
       5 colour-coded offloading zones                                6 start position
     X = long axis (0 = left end / cylinder room, 6.704 = right end / start), Y = 0 front edge -> 4.868 back edge.
     Walls 0.3 m high, 0.06 m thick. -->
